// 09 - THREE PUMPS IN PARALLEL
// THREE PUMP-FED SUPPLIES, EACH WITH ITS OWN CURVE, JOIN A COMMON HEADER BY
// SHORT LARGE PIPES AND FEED A SPRINKLER ARRAY AND A HYDRANT.  THE REPORT
// GRAPHS EACH SUPPLY, THEN ALL THREE COMBINED: THE CURVES ADDED IN FLOW AT
// EQUAL PRESSURE, AND THE FLOWS THEY DELIVER ADDED AS THE COMBINED DUTY.

TITLE     THREE PUMPS IN PARALLEL - WORKED EXAMPLE
PROJECT   JOB HC-DEMO-009
PROJECT   REVISION A
UNITS     LENGTH M
UNITS     ELEVATION M
UNITS     SIZE MM
UNITS     PRESSURE KPA
UNITS     FLOW LPM
UNITS     KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD    HW

WATER     PA 0.0 900 1500 820 3000 600
WATER     PB 0.0 900 1500 820 3000 600
WATER     PC 0.0 850 1200 760 2400 520
NODE      H 0.0
NODE      R1 6.0
NODE      R2 6.0
SPRINKLER S1 6.0 -100 80
SPRINKLER S2 6.0 -100 80
SPRINKLER S3 6.0 -100 80
SPRINKLER S4 6.0 -100 80
HYDRANT   HY 1.0 -350 65

USE       BORE 120
PIPE      PA1 PA H 2.0 200
PIPE      PB1 PB H 2.0 200
PIPE      PC1 PC H 2.0 200
PIPE      RS H R1 40.0 150
PIPE      R12 R1 R2 12.0 100
PIPE      B1 R1 S1 3.0 50
PIPE      B2 R1 S2 6.0 50
PIPE      B3 R2 S3 3.0 50
PIPE      B4 R2 S4 6.0 50
PIPE      HYL H HY 25.0 150
